<title>USA: Coralville, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 20:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Coralville, Iowa, won by Dain Bosworth. [CORRECTED 20:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company name from Harris Trust to Dain Bosworth.)</p>
<p>Dain Bosworth said it won $2.200 million of Coralville, Iowa, general obligation bonds, Series 1997 C, with a true interest cost of 5.2997 (corrects from 5.31) percent.</p>
</text>
